Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set FontSize 18
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "make build"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "./build/wassup --config /tmp/wassup-vhs-config.json --contacts docs/demo-contacts"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Tab
Sleep 1s
Shift+Tab
Sleep 1s

Type "/"
Type "maya"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Escape
Sleep 1s

Type "q"
